sequenceDiagram
    participant API as Backend API
    participant DB as Database
    participant FCM as Firebase FCM
    participant Device as Android Device
    actor U as Pengguna Target
    participant App as Mobile App

    note over API: Dipicu saat booking baru, status berubah, assign, atau selesai

    API->>DB: INSERT INTO notifications
    DB-->>API: notification_id

    API->>DB: SELECT fcm_token FROM users WHERE id = target
    DB-->>API: fcm_token

    API->>FCM: POST FCM v1 HTTP API dengan token dan payload
    FCM-->>API: 200 OK message_id

    FCM->>Device: Deliver push notification

    alt Aplikasi sedang terbuka foreground
        Device->>App: onMessage callback
        App-->>U: Tampilkan snackbar dan update badge
    else Aplikasi di background atau tertutup
        Device-->>U: Tampilkan notifikasi di system tray
        U->>Device: Tap notifikasi
        Device->>App: onMessageOpenedApp callback
        App-->>U: Navigasi ke detail booking terkait
    end
